<title>USA: U.S. SDR rate moved to 1.38701.</title>
<headline>U.S. SDR rate moved to 1.38701.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Monetary Fund said the exchange value of the U.S. dollar against the SDR was 1.38701, versus 1.38814 on Monday and 1.20635 on July 1, 1974.</p>
<p>Other currency values against the SDR today (July 1, 1974 rates in parentheses) were.</p>
<p> Deutsche Mark     2.42103   (3.06809)</p>
<p> French Franc	8.15701   (5.82126)</p>
<p> Japanese Yen	159.159   (343.773)</p>
<p> Pounds Sterling   0.833690   (0.505474)</p>
<p> Australian Dlr    1.84173   (0.809889)</p>
<p> Aust Schilling    17.0325   (22.0097)</p>
<p> Belgian Franc     49.9774   (45.9249)</p>
<p> Canadian Dlr	   n/a    (1.16295)</p>
<p> Danish Kroner     9.21737   (7.23304)</p>
<p> Indonesian Rupiah 3391.24   (501.291)</p>
<p> Iranian Rial	2432.72   (81.6734)</p>
<p> Italian Lire	2354.46   (779.746)</p>
<p> Kuwait Dinar	0.419751   (0.351685)</p>
<p> Dutch Guilder     2.72409   (3.20316)</p>
<p> Norwegian Kroner  10.1654   (6.59386)</p>
<p> Saudi Arab Riyal  5.19435   (4.25788)</p>
<p> S.A. Rand	   6.28107   (0.80200)</p>
